# Local GeoIP database file location (AD-2 Option B, design §3.2/§3.9).
#
# The transient GeoIP resolver reads a database file from disk in-process:
#   - local dev: this directory, pointed to by GEO_DB_PATH in `.env`
#     (e.g. GEO_DB_PATH=./data/geo/geo.db);
#   - Lambda: the file ships via a layer / bundled asset.
#
# The concrete vendor + database file is an open decision (design §10.9) and
# is out of scope for URL-7 — this directory only reserves the local path so
# the dev environment has a stable location for the file.
